{title: 353 - Father, Help Your People}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #353 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Eb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 353}
{meta: category Christian Church - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]Father, [Gm]help Your [Ab]people [Fm]in [Eb]this world [Gm]to build
[Ab]Something of [Bb]Your [Cm]kingdom [Gm/D]and to [Bb]do [Cm/Eb]Your [Bb]will,
[Cm]Lead [Fm]us to discover [Ab]partnership [Gm]in love;
[Eb]Bless [Db]our [Gm]ways of [Ab]sharing [Eb]and our [Cm/G]pride remove.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Eb]Lord [Cm]of [Gm]desk and [Ab]altar, [Fm]bind [Eb]our lives [Gm]in [Cm]one,
[Ab]That in work and [Bb]worship [Gm/D]love may set [Bb]the [Cm/Eb]tone.
[Cm]Give [Fm]us grace to [Cm]listen, [Ab]clarity [Gm]of speech;
[Eb]Make [Db]us [Gm]truly [Ab]thankful [Eb]for the [Cm/G]gifts of [Fm]each.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Eb]Holy [Gm]is the [Ab]setting [Fm]of [Eb]each room [Gm]and yard,
[Ab]Lecture hall and [Bb]kitchen, [Gm/D]office, shop, [Bb]and [Cm/Eb]ward.
[Cm]Holy [Fm]is the [Cm]rhythm [Ab]of [Bb/F]our [Fm]working [Gm]hours;
[Eb]Hallow [Gm]then our [Ab]purpose, [Eb]energy, [Cm/G]and [Fm]pow'rs.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Eb]Strengthen, [Gm]Lord, for [Ab]service [Fm]hand [Eb]and heart [Gm]and brain;
[Ab]Help us good relations [Gm/D]daily to [Bb]maintain.
[Cm]Let [Fm]the living [Cm]presence [Ab]of [Bb/F]the [Fm]servant [Gm]Christ
[Eb]Heighten [Gm]our devotion, [Eb]make our [Cm/G]life a [Fm]feast.
{end_of_verse}
